  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Ice V** (1 review): Stu begins singing an unidentified different song in the middle of this track [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **pre show**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Supreme Ascendancy**: rare: 7 archived performances [6]\n- **A New World *live debut**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance; with Leah Senior [6]\n- **Altered Beast I**: back after 41 archived shows (1568 days); rare: 11 archived performances; with Leah Senior [6]\n- **Alter Me I**: back after 31 archived shows (1129 days); with Leah Senior [6]\n- **Altered Beast II**: back after 31 archived shows (1129 days); with Leah Senior [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2022-10-05** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 122 min; rated 3.5/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording features an in-ear monitor feed, which the reviewer finds impressive [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Leah Senior [1]\n- Security was strict, denying entry for medical glucose tablets but missing a joint [5]\n- Crowd energy was high from the start of the drumming on this song [5]\n- The audience went crazy when the band started playing this track [5]\n- The band refers to the venue's porta-potties as spicy rooms [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2022-10-05**: taped by LeifH; transferred by LeifH; source: 2x IEM (in ear monitor) > A10 [1]. Also: Tape uses a wireless receiver to capture and mix two distinct monitor feeds; Audio captured from two in-ear monitors, transferred via USB to a PC [1][4]",
